  "description": "erection of a new entrance door to the front of the shop and the separation of the commercial unit from the residential flat above.\n\nThe proposed works will create an independent access to the shop unit, allowing it to operate separately from the residential accommodation above. This will improve functionality, privacy, and usability for both the commercial and residential spaces.\n\nThe separation of the shop and flat will enable the commercial unit to be rented independently, supporting local business use and contributing to the vitality of the area.\n\nThe proposed alterations are minor in nature and will not have a significant impact on the character or appearance of the existing building or surrounding area.",
